DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43726::$$$message_0371_0000_0000$$$::"The match is over!"::
43727::$$$message_0371_0001_0000$$$::"Heh. In this final bonus mode from the gods, you really think that legit heroines could beat us second-string ancestral heroines!?"::
43728::$$$message_0371_0001_0001$$$::"Makes sense... The harder I try here, the more they'll treat me as comic relief in the main story... Very well, Ms. Fujimura. You've bested me."::
43729::$$$message_0371_0001_0002$$$::"This wish-granting star is just right for a minor character like you."[nolr][p]::
43730::$$$message_0371_0001_0003$$$::"Heh. Gotta say, I don't mind that[l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR4A_TIG_0040 _name=藤ねえ] honesty of yours."::
43731::$$$message_0371_0001_0004$$$::"You were strong too, Tohsaka. This is just how the dice fell today, but I'm sure the lead role could fall back in your lap anytime."::
43732::$$$message_0371_0001_0005$$$::"As the more experienced person who's been in your shoes, you're the only one I'm rooting for."::
43733::$$$message_0371_0001_0006$$$::"Uh... What do you mean you've been in my shoes?"::
43734::$$$message_0371_0001_0007$$$::"Ehehe. Don't play dumb, you little rascal."::
43735::$$$message_0371_0002_0000$$$::"Now, back to your world with you. [nolr]To your second-string Tohsaka Shrine, just like my dojo.[whitestar]"::
43736::$$$message_0371_0002_0001$$$::"Ugh, I won't forget this insult, you crazy teacher!"[nolr][p]::
43737::$$$message_0371_0002_0002$$$::"And with that, Rin's dropped out of the war, too."::
43738::$$$message_0371_0002_0003$$$::"Both Sakura and Rin are crafty, though. They waited until the previous team lost and then challenged us when we were tired."::
43739::$$$message_0371_0002_0004$$$::"I guess they're rotten to the core. Any thoughts on that, Archer?"::
43740::$$$message_0371_0002_0005$$$::"Well... They [font italic=true]are[font italic=false] sisters. It's only to be expected that they'd behave similarly. Just consider it their way of getting along."::
43741::$$$message_0371_0002_0006$$$::"You're right. Hehe. Both you and Shirou have it rough."::
43742::$$$message_0371_0002_0007$$$::"...You said it. I have to admit, I've never had great luck with women."[nolr][p]::

